<title>USA: Telebras Jan-May net income R$1.179 mln.</title>
<headline>Telebras Jan-May net income R$1.179 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telebras on Wednesday said it had net income of R$1.179 million for the January-May 1997 period.</p>
<p>The company also said that net income for its holding company was R$1.475 million.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
</text>
